NNAAMMEE
     mmlloocckk, mmuunnlloocckk — lock (unlock) physical pages in memory

LLIIBBRRAARRYY
     Standard C Library (libc, -lc)

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ##iinncclluuddee <<ssyyss//mmmmaann..hh>>

     _i_n_t
